      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REAL ORSON (8) comes off an average run last start when eighth at Maitland over 400m behind Good Odds Keona (23.22) in a Grade 5. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. SILVER CHAIN (3) was below best at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh at this track, but was among the placings at this track three back. With a good start should be able to take advantage of the low draw. Can find the frame this time. CORLESS SNEAKY (1) jumped from an outside draw but scored by half a length (18.74) at Richmond in Grade 5. Missed the frame only look here. Good beginner assisted by the inside draw. Can make it two on the bounce. KALANI MISS (2) looks an each-way chance.",
